	<entry name="Chainfist" value="Chainfist"/>
	<entry name="ChainfistFlavor" value="A Chainfist is a Power Fist fitted with a chainblade attachement designed to carve its way through armoured bulkheads. Originally designed for getting into ships during boarding actions, the whirring adamantine blades of a Chainfist have long since proven their worth when engaging armoured targets of all kinds."/>
	<entry name="EctoplasmaCannon" value="Ectoplasma Cannon"/>
	<entry name="EctoplasmaCannonFlavor" value="The Ectoplasma Cannons channels the raw daemonic energy from the Warp into searing, cometary blasts that make a noise like the howls of the damned. Anything hit by an Ectoplasma Cannon is enveloped by screaming tortured souls that dance in the flames."/>
	<entry name="EradicationBeamerDissipated" value="Eradication Beamer (Dissipated)"/>
	<entry name="EradicationBeamerDissipatedFlavor" value="The thin yellow beam fired by the Eradication Beamer widens as it projects outward from the weapon's distinctive muzzle. Those in the middle distance will be ravaged on a molecular level by its impossible technologies. Those close are simply atomised, their physical forms scattered to the hot winds of war without a sound."/>
